WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.992
Unit twenty-three. Heat Illness!

2
00:00:04.941 --> 00:00:08.669
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.719 --> 00:00:12.137
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.188 --> 00:00:15.656
Today we learn about Heat Illness. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.474 --> 00:00:20.574
Heat exhaustion. Say it with me. Heat exhaustion!

6
00:00:24.073 --> 00:00:27.907
Heatstroke. Say it with me. Heatstroke!

7
00:00:31.407 --> 00:00:34.740
Water. Say it with me. Water!

8
00:00:38.242 --> 00:00:41.542
Shade. Say it with me. Shade!

9
00:00:45.041 --> 00:00:48.374
Dizzy. Say it with me. Dizzy!

10
00:00:51.876 --> 00:00:55.076
Sweating. Say it with me. Sweating!

11
00:00:58.575 --> 00:01:02.592
Emergency. Say it with me. Emergency!

12
00:01:06.103 --> 00:01:09.286
Cool. Say it with me. Cool!

13
00:01:12.774 --> 00:01:22.258
Heat exhaustion causes heavy sweating, dizziness, and tiredness. Move to shade, drink water, and cool down. Heatstroke is an emergency — call for help immediately.

14
00:01:22.308 --> 00:01:23.512
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.938 --> 00:01:30.216
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.266 --> 00:01:31.416
Water!

17
00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:37.495
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.545 --> 00:01:38.695
Emergency!

19
00:01:39.818 --> 00:01:47.222
Did you know? Heatstroke can happen when the body stops being able to cool itself — it needs emergency help!

20
00:01:47.272 --> 00:01:49.363
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:50.104 --> 00:01:58.210
Think and answer. What should you do if a friend feels dizzy in the heat?

22
00:01:58.260 --> 00:01:59.410
Great answer!

23
00:02:00.648 --> 00:02:05.792
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:05.842 --> 00:02:08.493
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

